HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0525.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0526.fits,spectra0527.fits, spectra0528.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0529.fits,spectra0530.fits were combined using a robust          HISTORY weighted meanwith a sigma threshold of 8.  Aperture 1                   HISTORY modifications: Thescale factors were determined using order 1           HISTORY and are:1.0125076486325308, 0.9611922663104077,                         HISTORY 0.9603094780922015,1.0004502490389975, 0.9995501560446199,              HISTORY 1.0278739267919477.                                                     END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             